    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 32 was referred to as the 'Heart and Soul of the Constitution' by Dr. B.R. Ambedkar.",
        "Fundamental Rights guaranteed under Articles 20 and 21 cannot be suspended even during a National Emergency.",
        "Writs can be issued by the Supreme Court under Article 32 and by High Courts under Article 226 for the enforcement of fundamental rights."
      ],
      "id": "etg88ax"
